    <p class="content-note">Holafly's price is per day of unlimited use; Airalo's is per gigabyte. They're not directly comparable numbers: a 3-day US trip using under 3GB total would likely cost less on Airalo; the same trip streaming video or navigating constantly would likely cost less on Holafly.</p>
